//Difference between findelement and findelements

Scenario 1: (single webelement)
findelement - it will return single webelement
findelements - if the locator has single webelement -> it will print the webelement with a return type of list webelement

Scenario 2: (what if multiple webelement found)
findelement - it will print the first webelement with matching locator
findelements - it will print all the webelements that are matching the locators.

Scenario 3: (What if no webelement matches the locator)
findelement - it will throw exception as NoSuchElementException
findelements - it will return 0 / empty list -> it doesn't throw any exceptions

